            <div xml:id="d870">

                <pb facs="1147" n="1137" sameAs="frus:frus1946v10/pg1137"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">123 [Chase, Augustus S.]: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Consul General at Mukden</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Clubb</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1946-04-18T18:00:00-05:00">April 18, 1946—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>7. Text your telegram has been repeated Chungking with Dept’s approval in
                    principle (Urtel 26, Apr 15) but with final authority resting with General
                    Marshall.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Byrnes</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
